hits.text:
RSI loops are moving out of the frontier labs.

@hedra_labs just launched Model Factory for teams in robotics, manufacturing, biology, and defense. Bring a simulator or RL environment, and their AI scientists run post-training while Hedra researchers steer.

They first tested it on their own H3 video model. 34.9 on Physics-IQ vs. 30.3 for H3 Max.

